  "review": {
    "note": "Reviewed official PyPI/npm metadata and upstream release notes on 2026-10-23 for distlib 0.4.4, packaging 26.3, build 1.6.1, hatchling 1.32.4, mypy 2.4.0, pytest 9.1.1, pytest-xdist 3.8.0, Ruff 0.17.2, and markdownlint-cli2 0.24.0. All latest stable releases satisfy declared lower bounds; no latest stable is excluded. Python 3.14 is explicitly classified by Python dependencies except pytest-xdist, whose >=3.9 metadata permits it; worker regressions remain required. Node >=22 is compatible with installed Node 24.22.0. Reviewed distlib launcher fixes, build Windows symlink fix, Hatchling plugin fix, mypy native parser, Ruff rule/formatter and Markdown rule updates. This replacement preserves the exact previously tested portable implementation (53 targeted cases passed, 3 native Windows skips) and includes the separately formally merged verification bootstrap fix. The normal implementation commit fast gate passed with current local tools. Native Windows and the new exact-candidate full gate are not claimed by this audit.",
